{title: Itna Na Mujhse Tu Pyar Badha}
{artist: Talat Mahmood Lata Mangeshkar Salil Chowdhury}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Itna na mujhse tu pyaar badha,        [Am]ki main ik badal [Dm]aawara
[Dm]kaise kisi ka sahara [G]banoon,        [G]ki main khudh beghar [C]bechara
[Am]Isliye tujhse main pyaar karoon,        [Am]ki too ik badal [Dm]aawara
[Dm]janam janam se hoon saath [G]tere,        [G]hai naam mera jal ki [C]dhara
Mujhe [C]ek jagah aa [G]raam nahi,        [G]ruk jana mera [C]kaam nahi
Mera [Am]saath kahan tak [F]dogi tum,        main [G]desh videsh ka [Am]banjara
[Am]Itna na mujhse tu pyaar badha...        o [Am]neel gagan ke [G]deewane
too [G]pyaar na mera [C]pahchane,        main [Am]tab tak saath [F]chaloon tere
jab [G]tak na kahe too [C]main haara,        [Am]Isliye tujhse main pyaar karoon...
[C]kyoon pyaar main too [G]nadaan bane,        ik [G]pagal ka ar [C]maan bane
Ab [Am]laut ke jaana [F]mushkil hai,        maine [G]chhod diya hai [C]jag sara
[Am]Itna na mujhse tu pyaar badha,        [Am]ki main ik badal [Dm]aawara
[Dm]janam janam se hoon saath [G]tere,        [G]hai naam mera jal ki [C]dhara
